Create Notes - Zoho CRM API
  URL: https://www.zoho.com/crm/developer/docs/api/v8/create-notes.html
  # Create Notes
### Request Details
#### Supported modules
Leads, Accounts, Contacts, Deals, Campaigns, Tasks, Cases, Events, Calls, Solutions, Products, Vendors, Price Books, Quotes, Sales Orders, Purchase Orders, Invoices, Appointments, Services and Custom

#### Sample Request
```curl
Copiedcurl "https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Leads/1000000145990/Notes"
-H "Authorization: Zoho-oauthtoken 1000.8cb99dxxxxxxxxxxxxx9be93.9b8xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxf"
-d "@newnote.json"
-X POST
```

