Get Notes Data API - Zoho crm
  URL: https://www.zoho.com/crm/developer/docs/api/v8/get-notes.html
  # Notes APIs
### Request Details
#### Sample Request
```curl
Copiedcurl "https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Notes?fields=Parent_Id,Owner,Created_Time,Note_Title"
-X GET
-H "Authorization: Zoho-oauthtoken 1000.8cb99dxxxxxxxxxxxxx9be93.9b8xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxf"
```

```deluge
